  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[dmd](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dmd) just published its new version 1.4.2.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :rotating_light:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      dmd\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      1.4.2\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build went from success to failure**.\n\nAs dmd is “only” a devDependency of this project it **might not break production or downstream projects**, but “only” your build or test tools – **preventing new deploys or publishes**.\n\nI recommend you give this issue a high priority. I’m sure you can resolve this :muscle:\n\nOf course this could just be a false positive, caused by a flaky test suite, or third parties that are currently broken or unavailable, but that would be another problem I’d recommend working on.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 2 commits .\n- [`bc7de45`](https://github.com/jsdoc2md/dmd/commit/bc7de45c0d186f254c2e892abfb3badbd6670508) <code>1.4.2</code>\n- [`6e0ba0b`](https://github.com/jsdoc2md/dmd/commit/6e0ba0b74619253765d3f3f389e2b815d0ded82f) <code>upgrade deps</code>\n\nSee the [full diff](https://github.com/jsdoc2md/dmd/compare/7617605331b76d9a14b195a61b0b85f7a9474e5e...bc7de45c0d186f254c2e892abfb3badbd6670508).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
